<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11363" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμφι-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take off</i> a garment, <i>doff</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.406d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.393
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.49
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Bianor</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμφιάσαντες τὴν ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					21.249d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμφιάσασθαι τὰ περίαπτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.288
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>lay bare, reveal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κεκρυμμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.310
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνὴ καὶ ἀπημφιασμένη ἀλήθεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.362
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>strip off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.76
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>):— hence Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμφί-ασις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
				<i>putting off,</i> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				19.2.5
			</span></i>.</div>
